# A reload while the service stops: off the HEALTH thread the stop is not counted (only HEALTH's own walks end at
# it), so the reload's walk goes on to its end: every alert REMOVED and linked again on both charts, as in `same`.
database real
queue 1
health-dirs tests/corpus/reload/v1.d -
rules tests/corpus/reload/v1.d/a.conf
chart loop.r loop.r_name loop.reload disks things 1
chart loop.s loop.s_name loop.reload disks things 1
var loop.r v 70
var loop.s v 70
register
clock 0
pass 0
store
clock 1
pass 1
store
clock 2
running 0
reload
store
running 1
clock 3
pass 3
store
